    "section": "15. Stratagems",
    "ruleNumber": "15.06",
    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your Shooting phase on a friendly **EXPLOSIVES** or **GRENADES** unit that is **unengaged**, eligible to shoot and made no [Advance Move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) this turn.\n\n1. Pick a model in it with either keyword.\n2. Pick an enemy unit that is **unengaged**, [visible](vsdata:core-rule/visibility) to that model and within 8″ of it.\n3. Roll 6D6; each 4+ inflicts 1 [Mortal Wound](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds) on that enemy.",
